<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/contextually-rich-learning-environment> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/editorialExplanation> "A design that works in one setting may fail in another, so learning technologies often need to account for local context rather than assume a single common environment." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/contextually-rich-learning-environment/versions/1> .
